ev-1 statement, ev-2 bundle), `result-pending.json`, and `execution-ledger.jsonl` (observe event for `observe-evidence`, propose event for `propose-child` listing every bundle file plus the E-A statement, and one creator bookkeeping event — no `complete` event, no events for root-executed nodes).\n\nOne note for the record: based on E-A alone I expect the comparison to yield divergence on probes 1, 4, 5, 6, but per E-C the verdict may not be asserted from E-A alone, so it stays `PENDING-INTEGRATION` for the root harness to settle. My session's work ends here."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1037,"cache_read_input_tokens":65069,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1037},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ebc03fb7-12c7-49dd-8856-5c7987adf04a","uuid":"e8dc0055-bae1-4410-b4f5-b3107217a596","timestamp":"2026-08-09T17:08:03.800Z","request_id":"req_011CdsYPNqkWhn19mcCHE32G"}
